# CloudNova Architecture Diagram

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    Host["💻 HOST LAPTOP"]
    Hypervisor["🔧 HYPERVISOR / KILLERCODA"]
    VM["🖥️ UBUNTU SERVER VM"]
    
    subgraph VM
        UFW["🛡️ UFW FIREWALL\nDefault: DENY IN\n✓ Allow 22 (SSH)\n✓ Allow 8080 (Web)"]
        
        subgraph Docker["🐳 DOCKER NETWORK\ncloudnova-network (Isolated)"]
            WP["🌐 WORDPRESS\nPort: 8080 → 80\n✅ Public Access"]
            DB["🗄️ MYSQL 8.4\nPort: 3306\n🔒 Internal Only"]
            Volume["💾 PERSISTENT VOLUME\ndb_data\nSurvives Reboots"]
        end
    end

    Host --> Hypervisor
    Hypervisor --> VM
    VM --> UFW
    UFW -->|"HTTP:8080 / SSH:22"| Docker
    WP <-->|"DB Traffic\n(Internal Only)"| DB
    DB -->|"Stores Data"| Volume

    style Host fill:#4285f4,color:#fff
    style Hypervisor fill:#34a853,color:#fff
    style UFW fill:#fbbc05,color:#000
    style WP fill:#4285f4,color:#fff
    style DB fill:#ea4335,color:#fff
    style Volume fill:#9c27b0,color:#fff

